cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "dopplerkit: Doppler and range-rate link geometry with explicit one-way/two-way sign conventions"
abstract: >-
  Range, range-rate, one-way and two-way Doppler, Doppler rate, carrier
  pre-compensation and light-time correction for a satellite link, with the sign
  convention stated at every interface. Validation level 1: closed-form known
  answers and internal consistency. Research-grade and educational; not
  flight-qualified, not certified.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-04
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "OPTIMA Organisation"
repository-code: "https://github.com/OmAcharya-avtr/dopplerkit"
keywords:
  - doppler
  - range-rate
  - satellite communications
  - link geometry
  - light time
